{"format_version":1,"id":"18c8992d0a0e24f716f00e6365f74172a40e6f2faa5d7456","commits":["4a202430c0632955a740bc45727c0c5af0f8101c","22a9599978cda6d8ae40c26127c179dd144bb237","4fdc23f0acab5b7b1e1e2ba8da6a6fe6f280e7ad"],"user_facing":true,"description":"**The seed catalog, end-to-end.** `strictcode analyze` runs the eleven import-graph rules (dependency hygiene, dead code, cycles, config staleness, library boundary) over Python, Go, and TypeScript/JavaScript workspaces: text or JSON output, error findings fail the run, warnings do not. The 32-item lessons register is the acceptance suite.","type":"feature"}
