{"format_version":1,"id":"18c8b53562daf23947b21579ea474e65a43cfa7a2af81f1a","commits":["99f6e3d6986f6c126da394021ec7c4b7ff684be1","e022be0d80054d8d3403fc05bf41766566ad86ff","4b987e343e5e979c66bdfc5d66022235a5cbc809"],"user_facing":true,"description":"**Python full-semantic depth.** The graph now carries Python callables, classes (with protocol/enum classification), lambdas, containment, decorator and inheritance/ABC-register conformance edges, and syntactically resolved calls \u2014 dynamic dispatch stays honestly unresolved, never guessed. Completes the rule set: `library-stdout` (error), `library-direct-logging` (warning), and `unreachable-code` (error, all projects).","type":"feature"}
{"format_version":1,"id":"18c8b5356bb63b8fe89ce641a47f44e28c3c4bd7a8b7dafb","commits":["da847acd5635310b485b779e208a111a4a2edf1b"],"user_facing":true,"description":"**Tier-1 auto-fixes.** `strictcode fix --preview|--apply` removes unreachable statements \u2014 the transform is whitelisted, and every application is verified by re-extracting the graph and comparing it against the declared delta; a mismatch rolls the files back.","type":"feature"}
